-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  prj_pack_err_noproject.pcpp - Projects: pcpp pack on a folder with no
  project.toml

  The folder named is the project (never searched above), as for pcpp
  build: this area's own folder holds no project.toml, a bad argument
  (exit 2), and nothing is built or packed. A cli test (pcpp itself, in the
  suite's output root); this file itself is never compiled.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe prj_pack_err_noproject;

/*
  @@test
    kind cli
    args "--no-banner pack <DIR>"
    exitcode 2
    expect
    | Error: No project.toml in <DIR>
  @@end
*/

begin
end.
